      "prompts": {
        "midjourney_v6": "An ultra-modern mobile app UI screen displaying local Vietnamese restaurant menu and food delivery, inspired by ShopeeFood and GrabFood, shown on an iPhone 16 Pro mockup. Top header shows restaurant profile: 'Quán Ăn Cô Ba - Cổng Chợ Phước An', verified blue badge, 4.9 star rating (680 reviews), and an orange tag 'Giao nóng hổi trong 20 phút'. Below is a horizontal scrolling pill filter bar: 'Tất cả quán', 'Bún Đỏ & Phở Khô', 'Cơm Tấm Sườn Nướng', 'Trà Sữa & Cà Phê', 'Món Ăn Vặt'. The main catalog is a 2-column food grid with delicious high-end photography: 1. Steaming hot Đắk Lắk Red Noodle Soup (Bún Đỏ) with quail eggs, crab roe, and crispy pork crackling (35.000đ). 2. Charcoal-grilled pork chop broken rice (Cơm Tấm Sườn) with fried egg (35.000đ). 3. Gia Lai Dry Pho (Phở Khô Hai Tô) with beef broth (45.000đ). 4. Steamed rice sheets with grilled pork (Bánh Ướt Chồng Đĩa - 40.000đ). 5. Brown sugar boba milk tea with cream cheese (28.000đ). Bright ShopeeFood orange #EE4D2D price tags, rounded orange '+' add to cart buttons, bottom floating cart summary pill with 2 items (85.000đ). Clean Vietnamese typography, Figma presentation style, hyperrealistic 8k render --ar 9:16 --v 6.0",
        "dalle_3": "Mobile app UI screen for local Vietnamese restaurant delivery in Đắk Lắk. Top banner features a restaurant header with 'Quán Ăn Cô Ba'. Food category pills for noodles, broken rice, milk tea. 2-column food grid featuring authentic Vietnamese dishes: Bún Đỏ red noodles, Cơm Tấm pork chop rice, Phở Khô, and boba milk tea. Vibrant food photography, orange prices in VNĐ, '+' buttons, and floating bottom cart bar. Clean dark slate background, modern UI.",
        "flux_sdxl": "professional UI design, food delivery mobile application, ShopeeFood style, appetizing photography of Vietnamese dishes, Bún Đỏ Đắk Lắk, Cơm Tấm, Phở Khô, dark mode #090D16, orange accents #EE4D2D, crisp typography, 2-column card grid, high contrast, clean interface, Figma Dribbble trending"
