        "midjourney_v6": "A full-screen vertical short-form video interface inspired by TikTok, displayed on an iPhone 16 Pro mockup. The video background shows a steaming hot, vibrant bowl of authentic Vietnamese Bún Đỏ noodle soup being scooped with fragrant red broth, quail eggs, and golden crackling at a lively street food restaurant stall in Phước An, Đắk Lắk. On the right vertical action bar: profile avatar with plus icon, heart like icon with count '14.2K', comment icon '420', share icon, and spinning vinyl music record at bottom right. On the bottom left, clean overlaid white text: '@quancoba: Tô bún đỏ nóng hổi chiều tan tầm tại Chợ Phước An, tóp mỡ giòn rụm giao tận nhà 20 phút! 📍 Chợ TT. Phước An, Krông Pắk'. Directly above the caption is an eye-catching floating golden-yellow interactive card (TikTok yellow basket style): on the left, a food icon with text 'Bún Đỏ Đặc Biệt - 35.000đ', on the right two pill buttons: 'ĐẶT MÓN' in yellow, and 'ĐẶT XE TỚI QUÁN' in Grab green. Immersive high-contrast mobile UI, vivid cinematic lighting, 8k resolution, award-winning social media UI design --ar 9:16 --v 6.0",
