      "prompts": {
        "midjourney_v6": "A professional mobile app UI design of a Driver Partner telematics and dispatch console, shown on a smartphone mounted on a car dashboard. Top header shows driver profile: 'Ba Cường (Xpander 7 Chỗ - 47A-528.39)', rating ⭐ 4.95, and a large illuminated toggle switch 'ĐANG BẬT NHẬN CUỐC' in glowing emerald green. The upper middle section features a compact GPS radar map showing driver position at 'Cổng Chợ Phước An' with scanning radar pulse animation. The center screen displays a prominent glowing incoming dispatch alert card with green pulse border: 'CUỐC XE MỚI - Đón: Chợ TT. Phước An ➔ Trả: BV Đa Khoa Vùng Tây Nguyên', passenger note 'Khách đi khám bệnh sáng', fare '50.000đ (Tài xế thực nhận 42.000đ sau trừ 16% phí sàn)'. Two large action buttons: 'Bỏ qua' (slate gray) and 'NHẬN NGAY' (large pulsating emerald green #00B14F). Bottom section displays financial ledger: Wallet balance '1.250.000đ', completed trips '11 cuốc hôm nay', and a button 'Rút Về Napas 247'. High-contrast dark mode #090D16, professional driver cockpit UX, crisp typography, 8k --ar 9:16 --v 6.0",
